                                // intercept (LlvmBackend_Exprs.cpp) -- see its
                                // comment there for the full mechanism. When
                                // `entry` (a DrainedEntry<K,V> loop variable)
                                // has been captured by an escaping closure,
                                // `locals_[entry]`'s `localSlot()` alloca is
